* Customer Storage integration verified

## Subscription

* Manual payment flow tested
* Invoice flow tested
* Expiration tested
* Pause/resume tested

## Service Models

* Managed tested
* Customer DB tested
* Customer Storage tested
* Unauthorized service-model change blocked
* Infrastructure approval tested

## Migration

* Validation tested
* Migration tested
* Verification tested
* Cutover tested
* Rollback tested
* Data integrity verified

## Agent

* Universal Agent build verified
* Organization binding verified
* Runtime entitlement verified
* Revocation verified
* Offline handling verified
* Version compatibility verified
* No customer infrastructure secrets embedded

## UI

* Loading states
* Empty states
* Error states
* Retry states
* Permission states
* Pagination
* Migration states
* Validation states
* Approval states

## Operations

* Logs
* Monitoring
* Storage monitoring
* Database monitoring
* Agent monitoring
* Audit logs
* Migration monitoring

